creatures:
- name: Wyvern
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 127 (rollable(dice=15d10 + 45,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Fly 80 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Initiative) (10)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 14  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 6 (2,300 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The wyvern makes one Bite attack and one Sting attack.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ***Sting.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Sting]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Sting]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=7d6,dicelabel=Damage [Sting]) Poison damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of the wyvern's next turn.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
